Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1036-1037] Onigashima 41 - Drunken Dragon Bagua.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.08,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Subtitles by HatSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.91,0:02:08.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King has just met his defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.37,0:02:10.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What, now?\NAre you certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.63,0:02:13.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The All-Stars and\Nthe Flying Six, annihilated...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.46,0:02:16.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is most serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.30,0:02:22.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.30,0:02:29.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,two monsters yet remain, both capable of\Nrendering the Straw Hats' heroics...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.94,0:02:32.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blast Breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.23,0:02:36.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...utterly meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.15,0:02:41.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The battle between Luffy and Kaido\Nhits peak intensity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.28,0:02:46.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However, there is another side\Nto this decisive battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:49.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy's victory over Kaido\Nwill cause...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.66,0:02:48.16,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1448,726)}Gunpowder
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.66,0:02:49.16,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(907,652)}Flame\NClouds
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.58,0:02:51.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the Flame Clouds to dissipate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.51,0:03:01.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onigashima will crash,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.43,0:03:05.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the gunpowder in its lowest level\Nwill detonate the Flower Capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.14,0:03:09.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tens of thousands of\Nunwitting attendees...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.52,0:03:12.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...enjoying the Fire Festival will perish!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.02,0:03:20.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will not let the island reach the Flower Capital,\Ncome what may!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.32,0:03:25.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To the abyss...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.33,0:03:30.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To the abyss...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.37,0:03:33.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And then there's the second crisis:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.12,0:03:36.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro's burning grudge,\Nplanted by Orochi,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.21,0:03:36.21,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\move(512,611,274,39)}Burning\NGrudge
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.67,0:03:40.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...moves toward Onigashima's lowest level,\Nintent on causing a midair explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.93,0:03:44.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato is in pursuit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.85,0:03:48.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.56,0:03:53.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rokki is obstructing the doors\Nto the basement!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.85,0:03:57.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I haven't the time to take him down,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:04:00.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,obtain the key\Nand pull the lever to open the doors!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.57,0:04:03.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you would, Fuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.63,0:04:22.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurray!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.30,0:04:24.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Fuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:28.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep Rokki occupied!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.11,0:04:40.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These wounds're serious...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.19,0:04:45.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My body is whole once again...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.15,0:04:47.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-How does your body even work?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.66,0:04:49.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.41,0:04:52.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've gotta get you both to Chopper\Nfor treatment ASAP!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.29,0:04:54.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:56.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let the Straw Hats get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.79,0:04:57.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.79,0:04:59.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make 'em dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.09,0:05:02.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why the hell did they have\Nto get here now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.89,0:05:13.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Exploding Skull Grass!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.35,0:05:20.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Check it out!\NThat guy's worth 200 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.02,0:05:21.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let him leave alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.19,0:05:24.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm screwed!\NI'm dead meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.49,0:05:26.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm surrounded by\Nthe flames and bad guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.78,0:05:28.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,U-Usopp-dono...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.95,0:05:31.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave me...\NHelp Kiku...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.95,0:05:36.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, Kin-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.50,0:05:38.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am beyond saving...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.83,0:05:41.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Suuure! I'm gonna leave you both here\Nand save my own skin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.88,0:05:46.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The hell's the point of me coming here then,\Nyou suicidal samufreaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:58.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dying with honor?\NCutting yourself open out of responsibility?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.27,0:06:02.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not into your culture!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.32,0:06:06.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll cling to life with snot running\Nfrom my nose, if I have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.86,0:06:09.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll go on living,\Nno matter how bad I look!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.99,0:06:16.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I survived all that,\Nand that's why I'm still kicking!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.37,0:06:21.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp-dono!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.54,0:06:25.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you idiots so satisfied\Nwith just pulling off your raid?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:29.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nopenopenopenopenope!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.72,0:06:35.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.18,0:06:36.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.24,0:06:56.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell's he doing here!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.70,0:06:59.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A former commander\Nof the Whitebeard Pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.46,0:07:01.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Izo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.33,0:07:04.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marco was on the\NPerformance Floor, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.04,0:07:05.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.17,0:07:08.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks, whoever you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.76,0:07:09.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Izo...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.89,0:07:20.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.19,0:07:24.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No speaking.\N'Tis bad for your wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:28.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can exchange stories to our hearts' content\Nafter the battle is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.99,0:07:29.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.03,0:07:32.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...I do not believe I can...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.07,0:07:36.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As your brother,\NI forbid you to give in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.37,0:07:40.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.29,0:07:42.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.08,0:07:47.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall rescue you both,\Nwhatever the cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.88,0:07:49.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is why...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.38,0:07:53.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you must live!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.60,0:08:03.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is, if you truly believe\Nin Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.23,0:08:05.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.61,0:08:10.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And you, Big Brother, must also...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.99,0:08:11.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...live!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.54,0:08:30.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,God Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.09,0:08:32.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huuuh?!\NYou know me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.72,0:08:36.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course!\NYou are the Sniper King!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.68,0:08:38.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.47,0:08:39.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take care of those two!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.85,0:08:41.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.44,0:08:47.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hamlet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.56,0:08:48.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.27,0:08:49.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's move!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.07,0:08:52.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Departure"! That means\Nwe're setting out on a new journey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.74,0:08:54.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.66,0:08:59.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,None shall pass this point!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.64,0:09:22.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The battle is ended!\NYou caught fire first!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.43,0:09:27.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Undo your Paralysis Technique, Raizo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.19,0:09:32.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After you, Fukurokuju!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.44,0:09:35.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If that is what you wish,\Nthen so be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.07,0:09:37.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How unfortunate for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.36,0:09:40.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your death will undo your technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.20,0:09:42.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am a retainer of Oden-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.66,0:09:45.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I feel no heat from this puny spark!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.08,0:09:53.59,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1634,334)}Second\NFloor
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.08,0:09:53.59,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1634,528)}Treasury
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.46,0:09:56.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is this a dream, or is this reality?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:59.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can scarcely believe Komurasaki,\Nwho I took for dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.89,0:10:02.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is at my side, playing the shamisen!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.26,0:10:04.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're late, Fukurokuju!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.60,0:10:08.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to make our escape\Nbefore the island explodes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.06,0:10:12.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My Lord, what is the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.27,0:10:15.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no... Nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.19,0:10:18.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know, Komurasaki!\NPlay that piece for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.86,0:10:23.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The song I love,\Nthe one you used to play for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.28,0:10:25.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.62,0:10:30.12,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1677,305)}Castle\NBasement
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.62,0:10:30.12,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1676,523)}Second\NFloor
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.13,0:10:38.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drake!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.93,0:10:43.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're outta here, Inbi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.35,0:10:49.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't gotta get mixed up\Nwith those freaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.56,0:10:54.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Zanki!\NLater, Drake!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.78,0:11:03.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How troublesome...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:06.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Still, that was to be expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:09.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apoo ran away...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.21,0:11:12.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ring, ring, ring...\NRing, ring, ring...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.88,0:11:13.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Clik.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.88,0:11:16.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you apprehended Nico Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.05,0:11:18.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not yet.\NWe were interrupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.42,0:11:19.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.63,0:11:21.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We must make our way\Nout of this castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.97,0:11:23.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The All Stars suffered\Na crushing defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.85,0:11:26.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.02,0:11:37.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If the new generation were to\Nsomehow claim victory,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.91,0:11:49.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And it would then serve\Nas a tailwind...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.25,0:11:52.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...for current events\Naround the world right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.12,0:11:58.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happens in the next few minutes\Nwill set the course for the coming era!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:12:00.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That may well be, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.47,0:12:03.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...don't you think they've...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.68,0:12:09.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...already hit the limit of what\Nhuman beings can achieve?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.20,0:12:30.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.22,0:12:53.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.84,0:13:26.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gear 3!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.31,0:13:39.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.90,0:13:40.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:40.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.65,0:13:42.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.11,0:13:50.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of hearing "Gum-Gum"!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.07,0:13:52.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roc Gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.66,0:14:37.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now I'm havin' fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.71,0:14:42.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So am I!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.88,0:14:52.89,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1694,192)}Flower\NCapital
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.88,0:14:52.89,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1695,631)}Land of\NWano
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.47,0:14:59.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That hit the spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.18,0:15:02.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Moderation, man!\NYou've had too much to drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.15,0:15:03.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.73,0:15:07.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Today's the only day of the year\Nwe get to drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.19,0:15:12.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Every other day's just misery,\Nlivin' here in this country...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.99,0:15:14.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.58,0:15:15.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You shi-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.08,0:15:16.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, knock it off,\Nknock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.08,0:15:20.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Public officials can be anywhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.50,0:15:21.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.58,0:15:27.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They've started preppin' the sky lantern boats...\NGuess the festival's comin' to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.55,0:15:35.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a lotta lanterns!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.93,0:15:38.43,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(679,549)}I hope to\Nbe able to\Nfeed my\Nchildren\Nevery day
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.43,0:15:40.43,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1301,552)}Wanna see my mom
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.90,0:15:50.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go on, write a wish\Nto send to your ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.74,0:15:52.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What should I wish for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.99,0:15:56.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't you write your wish, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.41,0:15:59.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Will my wish come true?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.50,0:16:06.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your ancestors in heaven,\Nwill discover your sky lantern boat,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.04,0:16:08.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and surely grant your wish then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.30,0:16:13.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Will Daddy read it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.18,0:16:16.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He certainly will!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.40,0:16:36.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why the hell're ya drinkin'?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.62,0:16:40.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause I'm having fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.70,0:16:44.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're havin' the Fire Festival\Ntoday in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.75,0:16:48.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were supposed to have a huge feast\Nhere on Onigashima, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.13,0:16:51.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But your bunch went and crashed the party,\Nmade a mess of it all...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.21,0:16:54.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya want some o' this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.63,0:16:57.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya look like\Nyou're enjoying yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.22,0:16:59.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drunk off your ass?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.64,0:17:05.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As if I'd get drunk\Noffa this little bit o' swill!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.19,0:17:09.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My great feast...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:14.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You totally wrecked my party...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:29.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're totally drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.21,0:17:34.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.59,0:17:40.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell're ya doin'?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.68,0:17:45.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you really fight like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.60,0:17:50.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If ya lose, I don't wanna hear excuses like\N"I was drunk"!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.28,0:17:57.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya duuumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.99,0:18:06.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why would I wanna\Nmake myself weaker?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.91,0:18:09.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take it as a sign that\NI've accepted ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.00,0:18:13.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.81,0:18:25.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drunken Dragon Bagua!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.60,0:18:25.10,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1432,379)}Drunken Dragon Bagua
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.39,0:18:27.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.60,0:18:30.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm feelin' real good now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.36,0:18:38.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When was the last time I met somebody\Nwho could really go toe-to-toe with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.71,0:18:53.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lightning Hammered...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.42,0:18:57.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Ragnaraku!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.21,0:19:36.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This place is useless to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.21,0:19:41.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The island's a total junkyard...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.88,0:19:45.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's fun, but at the same time,\Nthe castle's half destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.39,0:19:51.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit...\NCan't even defend my own castle...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.85,0:19:53.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess I don't got it anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.61,0:19:55.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever "it" is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.98,0:19:58.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gotta rebuild.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.94,0:20:04.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It took five years to build, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.20,0:20:06.20,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1368,553)}Drowning His Sorrows
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.16,0:20:14.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I felt that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.04,0:20:15.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That son of a...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.13,0:20:17.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.84,0:20:21.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are ya actually drunk?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.30,0:20:29.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I sold weapons here and there,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.22,0:20:33.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and even formed\Nthe world's strongest army usin' Smiles...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.85,0:20:37.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,did everything I could!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.61,0:20:43.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lettin' my guard down like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.11,0:20:44.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm such a moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.62,0:20:50.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But maybe I can't do this anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.67,0:20:58.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want it all gooooone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.42,0:21:03.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dragon Twister Demolition Breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.64,0:21:15.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That jackass is outta control!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.52,0:21:23.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just leave me alone,\NI'm beggin' ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.32,0:21:27.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The hell're ya on about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.70,0:21:29.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so ashamed...\NI regret everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.62,0:21:33.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm doomed!\NI... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.30,0:21:51.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.43,0:21:54.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you stupid dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.31,0:21:55.81,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1381,621)}Tears in His Beer
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.68,0:21:57.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's really throwin' me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.69,0:22:01.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whining hour's been over!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.86,0:22:07.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If yer not gonna go away,\NI'mma make you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.90,0:22:09.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thunder...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.53,0:22:11.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Bagua!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.08,0:22:23.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Swallow this, you drunk ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.75,0:23:03.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His Haki's getting stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.92,0:23:08.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just when I'm finally\Ngood and drunk...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.72,0:23:14.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop tryin' to sober me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.89,0:23:16.89,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(190,761)}Drunken Rage
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.08,0:23:38.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.54,0:23:43.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kundali...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.63,0:23:46.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Roc Gatling!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.34,0:23:49.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Dragon Swarm!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.98,0:24:51.49,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1700,409)}Holy Land of\NMary Geoise\NRed Line
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.03,0:24:54.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This year's Reverie is cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.91,0:24:58.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The total abolition of\Nthe Seven Warlords of the Sea...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.33,0:25:02.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The incident concerning\Nthe Kingdom of Alabasta...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.62,0:25:05.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Revolutionary Army's\Ninfiltration of Mary Geoise.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.17,0:25:08.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let us table those issues\Nfor the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.50,0:25:17.51,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(957,181)}Highest Authoritative Body in the World
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.50,0:25:17.51,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,506)}The Five Celestial Elders
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.84,0:25:12.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our immediate concern\Nis the Land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.88,0:25:17.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who would have imagined\Nthe battle reaching such intensity?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.22,0:25:19.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The time to act is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.18,0:25:23.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surely Nico Robin is\Nin our custody at this very moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.14,0:25:26.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In a battle against Kaido and Big Mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.23,0:25:30.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,casualties are... inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.23,0:25:32.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She must be erased!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.15,0:25:37.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As must the existence of\Nthat Devil Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.54,0:25:44.54,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1385,450)}At sea,\Nnear\NWano
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.58,0:25:47.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maintain combat readiness\Nuntil further notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.37,0:25:49.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All ships, remain on standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.64,0:26:07.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.27,0:26:08.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Situation report?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.10,0:26:13.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well...\NThere's this giant shadow...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.11,0:26:15.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A shadow?\NOf what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.44,0:26:17.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unknown...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.11,0:26:20.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell\Ndo you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.45,0:26:23.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A-An island...?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.54,0:26:26.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, that's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.62,0:26:31.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even to us, that fruit is but a legend!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.55,0:26:37.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It hasn't awakened for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.92,0:26:40.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, why would\Nthe World Government...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.34,0:26:44.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...deign to give that Devil Fruit\Nanother name?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.19,0:26:57.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To strike its name from history,\Nof course!
